## Copernicus-derived source tiles

The `artifacts/source_tiles/` portion of `risenyard/egms-qa-dataset` contains
measurements repacked from the European Ground Motion Service (EGMS) Level-3
Ortho Vertical product. Those measurements are Copernicus Land Monitoring
Service information and are distributed under the CLMS data policy:
https://land.copernicus.eu/en/data-policy

Source notice:

> European Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service information;
> https://doi.org/10.2909/4a14a29b-7db7-40e4-81ad-df3aa8dfbc6f

Modification notice: the measurements were selected, arranged into overlapping
7 km research tiles, filtered for the EGMS-QA encoder experiment, and stored as
compressed NumPy arrays. The release is not an official European Union, EEA,
Copernicus, or EGMS product, and no endorsement is implied.
